{{Quote|General, we found the Jedi. They're in hallway 328.|An [[OOM pilot battle droid]], to [[General]] [[Grievous]]|<ref name="Episode III" />}}
'''Hallway 328''' was a hallway on the ''[[Invisible Hand]]''. During the [[Battle of Coruscant]] it was where [[Supreme Chancellor|Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Palpatine]], [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]], and [[Jedi Knight]] [[Anakin Skywalker]] were trapped by a [[ray shield]]. They were then surrounded by [[droid]] forces.<ref name="Episode III" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The non-[[canon]] deleted [[death]] scene of [[Shaak Ti]] took place in Hallway 328.

